      "html": "<div id=\"step-q216495\" class=\"step questionWidget\" stepid=\"q216495\" questionid=\"216495\" format=\"MC\" answer=\"\" current=\"false\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 5</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"92\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"93\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"94\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is odd or <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"95\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is odd</p>\n<p>Given that the above predicate is defined over the universal set <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"96\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2115 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> which of the following statements are true?</p>\n<ol class=\"questionStatements\"><li>  The truth set of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"97\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"98\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2205\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </li><li>  The truth set of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"99\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"100\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2115 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </li><li>  <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"101\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2203\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2208\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2115 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </li></ol></div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-216495-a\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">a</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">I only</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-216495-b\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">b</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">III only</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-216495-c\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">c</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">I and III only</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-216495-d\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\" style=\"background: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: white;\">d</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">II and III only</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-216495-e\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">e</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">II only</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>The <em>existential quantification</em> of a predicate <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"102\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> defined over the universal set <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"103\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D448 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> transforms this predicate into a statement that we write as\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"104\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2203\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2208\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D448 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nThis statement is true if the predicate <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"105\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is true for a single element <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"106\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2208\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D448 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> i.e. if the truth set <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"107\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D447 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.12em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of the predicate is not empty:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"108\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D447 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.12em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2260\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2205\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>First, notice that:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>the truth set of \"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"109\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is odd\" is the set of odd natural numbers, and</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>the truth set of \"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"110\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is odd\" is the set of even natural numbers. </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>So, the truth set of our predicate is</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"111\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D447 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.12em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c20\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c20\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c62\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7D TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c76\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c20\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c20\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c62\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7D TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2115 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">{</mo></mrow><mtext>odd natural numbers</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">}</mo></mrow><mo>∪</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">{</mo></mrow><mtext>even natural numbers</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">}</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>With that in mind, let's inspect each of the given statements.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Statement I is false. The truth set is <em>not</em> empty.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Statement II is true. Indeed, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"112\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D447 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.12em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2115 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Statement III is true. Since <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"113\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D447 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.12em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is <em>not</em> empty, the statement <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"114\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2203\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2208\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2115 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is true. </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
